I don't like the current logo either, and I really think it would be a good
idea to create a new one.
To create a logo is a difficult task however, and in my opinion I think we
need professional help from an advertising agency or the like, to do it
properly (so we don't make a lot of effort now and then regret it after a
year or so). Professionals in this field have the experience and competence
to value which logo sticks out most and makes a professional impression of
the lojban project. If we just say to the agency which associations of the
logo we're looking for, then they could suggest an actual design. The
problem is probably that they don't do it for free (start a fund-raising?).
Venn's diagram isn't such a bad idea I think, but it looks really dull in
our logo right now, so maybe it works with a more artistic approach?

mu'o mi'e jongasib

2011/11/20 Pierre Abbat <phma@phma.optus.nu>

